# Search priority rule

Rank a cell highly when all four hold:

1. the historical problem has a real structural obstruction, not merely missing computation;
2. another school contains machinery aimed at precisely that obstruction;
3. the interaction produces a falsifiable exact statement;
4. the result would remain mathematically useful even if DCSG did not exist.

That is the operating definition of the Cold War Renaissance program.
